### Summary

The guard at reconcile-dialog.tsx:216 does what the PR says for the drag-to-copy case, and the review thread on it is addressed. There are no blockers. I raised three consider-level points: double-click now toggles once (a behaviour change the PR does not mention), a selection made elsewhere could suppress a toggle (depends on a browser behaviour I could not check from the repo), and the new test sits under a name that does not describe it and leaves the spy in place when it fails. I did not build or run anything; all claims come from reading the code.

